wait-for Make a quote card
# Today's poem is drawn again when PoetryDB answers, and a screen drawn
# again starts with its bar out of sight, so the touch waits for it.
wait-idle 3000
tap-at 536,12
wait-idle
expect Today's poem
clean
shot today
tap Browse
expect Browse
clean
shot browse
tap Search
expect Search poetry
expect Poets to start with
clean
shot search
# The search box raises the reader's keyboard, asking for what the scope looks in.
tap-id scope-poet
tap-id search-field
wait-for Type here
expect A poet's name
clean
shot search-keyboard
tap Back
wait-for Poets to start with
expect-missing Type here
